---
// windle is dark-only (packages/tokens defines no light theme), so the theme is pinned before first paint instead of
// read from localStorage / prefers-color-scheme. `StarlightThemeProvider` stays defined as a no-op for any caller.
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
  window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
